error[E0018]: 'b.arena' is not a name here, so the arena it reaches cannot be released

   ┌─ test/fail/12_reset_through_field.nul:11:5
   │
11 │     b.arena.reset()
   │     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^  'b.arena' is reached through a pointer, so it has no name here
   │
   = note: every value in an arena dies the instant it is released, and this
           function can see almost none of them. Allocating through a pointer
           stays safe; releasing does not.
   │
   = help: release it in the function that made it, where it has a name
   │
